{"overview":"این سریال بیشتر بر مشکلات خانواده ها در عصر جدید می پردازد ، زندگی با نژادهای مختلف ، سن های مختلف، اعتقادات مختلف و جنس های مختلف. در خانواده مدرن تضاد ها بیشتر از هر روز نمایان می شود و فاصله بین نسل ها بیشتر و بیشتر. همین تضاد هاست که ما را به خنده وا می دارد. در خانواده مدرن هر کس سعی می کند تا خود را با شرایط خانواده تطبیق دهد ولی هر چه بیشتر تلاش می کند شرایط کمیک تری خلق می شود…","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Pritchett-Dunphy-Tucker clan is a wonderfully large and blended family. They give us an honest and often hilarious look into the sometimes warm, sometimes twisted, embrace of the modern family.","tagline_en":"One big (straight, gay, multi-cultural, traditional) happy family.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":32,"y":null,"poster":"/yo58fhwUP04vquNcb1HkevwFabL.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2009,"poster":"/2MzNIjhYoS4em77Wn8xUVFAT2z.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2010,"poster":"/uhqaY0x2vpMp9466dosJEPa9F2K.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":2011,"poster":"/njTyvLDevH9g6cv28r3vnaP1TK3.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":2012,"poster":"/wKJLQOhvO7gPqpg161RhUuQOqrM.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2013,"poster":"/2FzKjTUR4GDCjmTIen2e1I4tqRS.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":24,"y":2014,"poster":"/dZTk9fQn9RQf9kHUkjw370sZRdp.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":22,"y":2015,"poster":"/uNXvoFRPfbIER6gEPD3gxcYK4T1.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/42fBkctzAewcHOIzgcnsO56HNxp.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":22,"y":2017,"poster":"/2hNhZyAeWlHpe5t29GtxojRYHxB.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2018,"poster":"/ukgHITPASkHeJHmFx0hljx4iGg3.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":18,"y":2019,"poster":"/8LJ2OdRFlP6djuIbXOt3lHX92wR.jpg"}],"episodes":250,"crew":["Steven Levitan","Christopher Lloyd"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"اد اونیل","role":"Jay Pritchett","photo":"/4RrxSno3UEtGWuMm4yJoaFzckpL.jpg","en":"Ed O'Neill"},{"name":"Sofía Vergara","r